What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
interface LeftSensor {
    default void scan() { System.out.print("L"); }
}
interface RightSensor {
    default void scan() { System.out.print("R"); }
}
class DualScanner implements LeftSensor, RightSensor {
    public void scan() {
        LeftSensor.super.scan();
        System.out.print("-");
        RightSensor.super.scan();
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new DualScanner().scan();
    }
}
```

